{"title":"2005 Austrian Mathematical Olympiad Final Round-Part 1/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Austrian_Mathematical_Olympiad_Final_Round-Part_1/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find all real solutions <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/2/332e0be21488326567b8089e48d87f6499f7f0dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b,c,d,e,f)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"110\" height=\"20\" /> of the system\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/c/e6c98b1510a9de27dcb3545ec84dd7a3c1533d92.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[4a = (b+c+d+e)^4, 4b = (c+d+e+f)^4, \\dots 4 f = (a+b+c+d)^4.\\]\" width=\"538\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Hint\">Hint</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Austrian_Mathematical_Olympiad_Final_Round-Part_1/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Hint\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Use the concept of <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Without_loss_of_generality\" title=\"Without loss of generality\">without loss of generality</a> to create an order relation between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/d/e6d5408a488bce30293b3e0dcd8cead0eff54bd5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b,c,d,e,f.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"100\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017164548\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.005 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.006 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 18/1000000\nPost‐expand